# .gitignore for a TwinCAT 3 project with a TcAgent pipeline - copy to the root of the repository as .gitignore.
# Patterns with "**/" match in every subfolder (the solution is often in a subfolder such as TwinCAT\).

# Visual Studio / TwinCAT build and IDE output
.vs/
**/_Boot/
**/_CompileInfo/
**/_Libraries/
*.~u
*.tpy
*.suo
*.user
*.bak
*.orig
*.compileinfo
*.tmc.bak
*.tsproj.bak
**/LineIDs.dbg
**/LineIDs.dbg.bak

# licenses are bound to a machine
*.tclrs

# TwinCAT HMI: NuGet packages are restored by Visual Studio, build output
**/Packages/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# TcAgent: backups stay local; coding rules, risk rules, lessons, doc-summaries.json, libraries.lock.json are versioned
**/.tcagent/backup/

# generated output (the pipeline publishes it as artifact)
**/doc/*.html
**/results/
**/sbom/
